{"meta":{"id":"tt28082769","type":"movie","name":"Septiembre 5","imdb_id":"tt28082769","description":"Durante los Juegos Olímpicos de Múnich de 1972, un equipo de transmisión estadounidense pasa de cubrir deportes a informar sobre una dramática situación de rehenes que involucra a atletas israelíes. Un joven productor, que inesperadamente dirige la transmisión en vivo, se enfrenta a decisiones difíciles mientras el tiempo se agota, los rumores se propagan y las vidas de los rehenes penden de un hilo.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt28082769.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s1PW2xCJPehFP4J5YNkg8GecBU7.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/61fcVxCAdPoc4UPPC40Y72CSR5k.png","genres":["Suspense","Drama","Historia"],"releaseInfo":"2024","released":"2024-11-07T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"91 min","imdbRating":"7.1","country":"Germany, United States of America","cast":["Peter Sarsgaard","John Magaro","Ben Chaplin","Leonie Benesch","Zinedine Soualem","Georgina Rich","Corey Johnson","Marcus Rutherford","Daniel Adeosun","Benjamin Walker","Ferdinand Dörfler","Solomon Mousley","Caroline Ebner","Daniel Betts","Leif Eduard Eisenberg","Sebastian Jehkul","Rony Herman","Jeff Book","Robert Porter Templeton","Stephen Fraser","Leon Dragoi","Doris Meier","Mark Ruppel","Christine Ulrich","Günther Wernhard","Antje Westermann","Harry Waterstone","Andreas Honold","Stefan Mittermaier","Miguel Abrantes Ostrowski"],"director":["Tim Fehlbaum"],"writer":["Tim Fehlbaum","Moritz Binder","Alex David","Tobias Madison"],"trailers":[{"source":"UHAL4cqvDE0","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler oficial [Subtitulado]","ytId":"UHAL4cqvDE0","lang":"es"},{"source":"m0-2fjqycz0","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler oficial en español","ytId":"m0-2fjqycz0","lang":"es"},{"source":"wn9AG514SQg","type":"Trailer","name":"Septiembre 5 (2024) - Trailer Español","ytId":"wn9AG514SQg","lang":"es"},{"source":"Azud40CQ3IE","typ